  "details": "The basic ask is to be able to affect players' voices in some way. Reverb, echo, or distortion.\nThis probably means applying those effects to the local player's AudioListener in such a way that includes other players' voices.\nIt'd also be great to apply effects to a speaker's voice directly, rather than at the point of the listener. But that's somewhat distinct.\n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/provide-api-to-copy-a-players-voice-to-specified-audio-sources",
